rades, and rehabilitates roads, bridges, and buildings. It also provides engineering and consultancy services, such as geotechnical and geo-environmental engineering; pavement, highway, and transportation engineering; asset and project management product, and personnel certification; and structural and material engineering services. In addition, the company develops residential and commercial properties; and develops, manufactures, and distributes pavement-maintenance materials, construction building supplies, petroleum-based products, and highway-safety equipment. Further, it provides civil engineering work and related services; solar panel installation contract works; supply of power and electricity derived from solar power plant; and green project management services. Additionally, the company engages in site investigation and soil testing activities, as well as operates and manages hotels, and processes and trades in fruits and related products. Protasco Berhad was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Kajang, Malaysia.","zh":"Protasco Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚提供基础设施解决方案。公司成立于1991年，总部位于马来西亚加影。","lines":["维护：为联邦和州道路提供日常维护、定期维护和紧急工程服务。","建筑：设计、建造、升级和修复道路、桥梁和建筑物。","工程与咨询服务：提供岩土与地质环境工程、路面、公路与交通工程、资产与项目管理产品及人员认证、结构与材料工程等服务。","房地产开发：开发住宅和商业物业。","贸易与制造：开发、制造和分销路面维护材料、建筑用品、石油基产品和公路安全设备。","清洁能源：提供土木工程及相关服务、太阳能电池板安装合同工程、太阳能电站供电以及绿色项目管理服务。"],"lines_en":["Maintenance: Provides routine maintenance, periodic maintenance, and emergency work services for federal and state roads.","Construction: Designs, constructs, upgrades, and rehabilitates roads, bridges, and buildings.","Engineering and Consultancy Services: Offers geotechnical and geo-environmental engineering, pavement, highway, and transportation engineering, asset and project management product and personnel certification, and structural and material engineering services.","Property Development: Develops residential and commercial properties.","Trading and Manufacturing: Develops, manufactures, and distributes pavement-maintenance materials, construction building supplies, petroleum-based products, and highway-safety equipment.","Clean Energy: Provides civil engineering work and related services, solar panel installation contract works, supply of power and electricity derived from solar power plant, and green project management services."]}}